      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5856,
      "src": "Tabla 9.7.6.2.2: s ≤ min(d/2 ; 600 mm) si V_s ≤ 0,33λ√f'c·b_w·d; si no, min(d/4 ; 300 mm)."
