      "id": "r137",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6048,
      "src": "Tabla 9.6.3.4(a)(b): A_v,min/s = el mayor de 0,062√f'c·b_w/f_yt y 0,35·b_w/f_yt."
